<title>POLAND: ELEKTROMONTAZ JUNE GROUP NET 700,000 PLN.</title>
<headline>ELEKTROMONTAZ JUNE GROUP NET 700,000 PLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary group results June</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> JUNE		     1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.74 vs   0.09</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 1.09 vs   0.09</p>
<p> Operating profit     1.11 vs   0.27</p>
<p> Sales		   19.17 vs   3.71</p>
<p> JANUARY-JUNE	   1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     2.94 vs   0.77</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 4.53 vs   0.96</p>
<p> Operating profit     4.10 vs   0.94</p>
<p> Sales		   85.85 vs  17.95</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish construction company is</p>
<p>Elekromontaz Eksport SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
